WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Variable products have a parent and variations. Start with parent product 39717. Parent settings apply when a variation inherits.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Open Variation A, number 39718. When fields say Use inherited setting, this variation follows the parent — or Default through the parent.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Variation B, number 39719, is useful to demonstrate an override. Only set a different value when this variation must differ.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Save authorised changes, then Preview for the exact variation ID you care about. Confirm Currently using and Ready.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
On the storefront, the customer must select a variation. Delivery options then refresh for that variation. Do not complete payment just for this video.
